</style></head><body><h1>Every file, and what it is</h1>
<p>The complete inventory — every document, workbook, dataset, script and source file
produced across the whole search, from the first sweep in July 2026 to the live site.
Nothing summarised away.</p>
<p><strong>Totals across everything:</strong> 1,839 opportunities · 88 countries · 1,433 real master's degrees · 530 verified by a second agent.</p>
<p><strong>If you only open four things:</strong></p>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th></th>
<th></th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><strong>https://zizoux0.github.io/master/</strong></td>
<td>The app — Door 3, all 398 records, your deadlines, your notes</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>results/MASTER-all-opportunities.xlsx</code></td>
<td><strong>Everything ever found</strong> — 1,839 rows, 88 countries, 20 tabs</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>results/THE-COMPLETE-GUIDE.md</code></td>
<td>The whole search written out — 551 lines</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>results/DOOR3.xlsx</code></td>
<td>The door you chose, 19 tabs</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<hr />
