</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong><code>ARTIST-ROUTE.md</code></strong></td>
<td style="text-align: right;">153</td>
<td><strong>Doors 1 and 3 together</strong>, built when you asked to focus on the two closest to being an artist. Door 1 = electronic/computer music, sound art, electroacoustic composition.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong><code>SHORTLIST.md</code></strong></td>
<td style="text-align: right;">130</td>
