</table>
<h3>Components</h3>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>File</th>
<th>What it is</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><strong><code>src/components/ChannelStrip.tsx</code></strong></td>
<td><strong>The signature.</strong> Rail texture = was this ever read by a human. Meter block = what came back, <strong>absent when nobody checked</strong>. Ladder = how tall the climb is, with a broken top rung for an audition.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>src/components/chips.tsx</code></td>
<td>Verdict word, level, gate, cost band, language — the small honest labels.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>src/components/Field.tsx</code></td>
<td>One labelled field, distinguishing <em>a value</em> from <em>UNVERIFIED</em> from <em>empty</em>.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>src/components/Layout.tsx</code>, <code>Filters.tsx</code></td>
<td>Page frame and filter controls.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>src/styles.css</code></td>
<td><strong>The whole design system in one file</strong> — six semantic tokens, the channel geometry, the type scale, one animation.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>src/fonts/*.woff2</code></td>
<td>Literata, Literata Italic, Archivo, Spline Sans Mono — subset to the 235 characters the data actually uses. 113 KB for all four.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>src/fonts/metrics.json</code></td>
<td>The computed <code>size-adjust</code> table that makes font loading cost <strong>zero layout shift</strong>.</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h3>Data layer</h3>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>File</th>
<th>What it is</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><code>src/data/calendar.ts</code></td>
<td>The time layer. <strong>Never reads the clock itself</strong> — <code>now</code> is always passed in, so every date is testable.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>src/data/money.ts</code></td>
<td>Scholarship eligibility and cost. <strong>Silence never counts as yes.</strong></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>src/data/search.ts</code></td>
<td>Hand-written weighted search. No library — a 195 KB index bought nothing over a scan of 398 records.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>src/data/filters.ts</code></td>
<td>The facet pipeline.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>src/data/dedup.ts</code></td>
<td>Duplicate grouping, deliberately <strong>without transitivity</strong> — union-find once merged 27 unrelated schools through a shared fees page.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>src/data/patterns.ts</code></td>
<td>Recognises the not-a-degree patterns.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>src/data/load.ts</code>, <code>src/store.ts</code></td>
<td>Loading, and your saved state.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>src/lib/format.ts</code></td>
<td>Rendering rules — including never printing a bare date for a <code>PRIOR CYCLE</code> deadline.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>src/types.ts</code></td>
<td>The shape of a record.</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
