<h3>Build scripts</h3>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>File</th>
<th>What it is</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><strong><code>scripts/build-calendar.mjs</code></strong></td>
<td><strong>Re-checks every calendar quote verbatim against its source and exits 1 if one doesn't match.</strong> Runs before every build, so a fabricated date cannot reach the site.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>scripts/build-fonts.mjs</code></td>
<td>Subsets the fonts and computes the metric overrides. <code>--check</code> fails on drift.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><code>scripts/build-data.mjs</code></td>
<td>Splits the exported data into what the app loads.</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
